{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RDfGwB6CHWoRr9t2ne8j0w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:10.905376+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RDfGwB6CHWoRr9t2ne8j0w","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0IEYjs1RfBtg8OVOBlCHdbkQOckDMruPZ9XWicHeuZbEaEElm4MTW3gVFbRJuqPiaBMWrvOXHvuFYR6ZfEZAONqw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0IEYjs1RfBtg8OVOBlCHdbkQOckDMruPEZHibdPo5GmMhPlt8CR1JyxJW57YeZpXIyVn0XZVjp3pEKQL8mKWoTw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎国内各高校优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读郑州大学力学与安全工程学院研究生！我院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生招生工作即将开始，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span> 提交材料  </span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>凡已取得或预计可取得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生且有意申请推荐免试攻读我院研究生的同学，请将以下材料按顺序扫描成一个PDF文件，并以“姓名+联系方式+本科学校+本科专业+拟推免研究生专业”命名，于2025年9月18日前发至指定邮箱（zzulxyyjs@163.com）。</span></p><p><span>1.考生亲笔签名的郑州大学推免预报名申请表；</span></p><p><span>2.身份证正反面及学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>3.本科前六个学期成绩单及综合成绩排名证明（须加盖院系或校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>4.外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级成绩）；</span></p><p><span>5.申请直博生提供2份《专家推荐书》，由所报考学科专业领域内的2名副教授以上专家撰写推荐意见并签名；</span></p><p><span>6.有关学术科研成果（发表论文、专利或参与科研项目情况等，论文提供封面及首页，没有可不提供）；</span></p><p><span>7.各类获奖、资格证书等体现自身学习和工作能力的材料（没有可不提供）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  招生专业及代码  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学术学位：080100力学、083700安全科学与工程</span></p><p><span>专业学位：085702安全工程</span></p><p><span>直博：080100力学</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>面试工作安排</span></b></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>面试时间按照中国研究生招生信息网系统报名时间确定，具体安排会在QQ群通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  其他事项   </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、政审、体检不合格以及在入学报到时未获得毕业证书及学士学位证书者，学校将取消其录取资格。资格审查不合格将不予录取。</span></p><p><span>2、全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统（预计9月中下旬）开放后，已具有推免资格的考生，须在系统中注册并填报志愿，根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、确认待录取等相应程序。</span></p><p><span>3、申请人必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。若申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，不予录取。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  学院联系方式   </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>郑州大学力学与安全工程学院研究生管理办公室（205室）</span></p><p><span>招生咨询电话：0371-67739359</span></p><p><span>QQ群：869975876</span></p><p><span>（申请推免的同学，请实名加入QQ群，验证时备注：姓名+本科院校+本科专业，如“张三+郑大+力学”）</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OYqAazc7wY0L9Pf6rJsgR5vqEAc31HQJicElTk8OhCiakZwJ3kzCAVoJia2l9SYMmRHmztFibzVU7uazR1U49f22yA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RDfGwB6CHWoRr9t2ne8j0w\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件一：2026年郑州大学推免预报名申请表.doc</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RDfGwB6CHWoRr9t2ne8j0w\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件二：2026年郑州大学申请直博生专家推荐书.doc</a></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>扫码关注我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/OYqAazc7wY0L9Pf6rJsgR5vqEAc31HQJ4T7QFVenQqnKdhTGicjOzjuib5OXBZgay6oeG4zEQ51icvBrwWnQUCVFQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>终审｜柯献辉</span></b></span></font></p><p><span><strong><span>复审｜</span></strong><strong><span>吴盛杰</span></strong></span></p><p><font><span><b><span>初审｜周</span><span><span>杨</span></span><span>杨</span></b></span></font></p><p><font><span><b><span>排版｜郭景阔</span></b></span></font></p><p><font><span><b><span>供稿｜研究生管理办公室</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"225678cc27f52c714a08a5907d1d133b8191c017ef271286bbc8bdff98e03119","textLength":961,"sourceSha256":"5cefc0b41fabbad17298eb55a99ad219154cb996bd19a0d5d1ed5852dfe626f3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-da96dbc4